    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Charlie. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764634754266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 37457,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764634760599999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. To get started, can you tell me what specifically is the issue with the item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764634762599999
    },
    {
