      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 37457,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764634770599999
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. And just to be sure I'm helping you correctly, is it a technical fault with the product, or more of a sizing or preference issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764634771866665
    },
    {
