      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 37457,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764634781133331
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. Getting blisters is definitely not the experience we want for our customers. I have your account pulled up here and I see the purchase was made 45 days ago. Let me just check the policy on that for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
